--[[====================================================================
    AFS MAIN  -  REN HUB V3  (Anime Fighters Simulator)
    Written from scratch.

    Tabs
      Main              auto farm (worlds / mobs / mode), quest, click, collect,
                        ult, mount, pet TP, next world, rebirth, re-equip pets
      Teleport          any world (numbered like the in-game list)
      Time Trial/Tower  trials multi-select, leave on floor, Infinity Tower
      Raid/Defense/Met. raid world + mode, defense, meteor / fallen star
      Dungeon/Gate/Time dungeon size + world, gates rank + amount, time chamber
      Game Mode         every event world the game has (auto-detected)
      Shop / Transfer   merchant, black market, passive transfer
      Open UI           open any in-game menu
      Hatch / Fuse      summon stars, fuse pets
      Passive           multi pet / slot / passive / rarity / machine reroll
      Settings          auto sell, webhook, anti AFK, ultra performance, walk speed, spy
      UI Settings       key, scale, accent (settings auto-save per account
                        to GravityHub/AFS/CONFIG/<player>.json)

    Click the floating R icon (or press RightControl) to open / close.

    Remote arguments: the game dump only lists remote NAMES. Every call goes
    through CFG.Calls. If something does nothing: Settings > Remote Spy, do
    the action once by hand, read F9, fix that line in CFG.Calls.
======================================================================]]

